 "about": "VERIFY_HARDENING 7.4: the draft classifier's rule table (tools/protect_map.py, WP8). Each rule maps an analysis protect item (catalog/analysis/part_*.jsonl, matched case-insensitively with re.search) to candidate guard references of the 7.3 grammar (by) and, for lights and doors, the protections.restore revocation the item needs (restore, 6.7). Candidates are drafts the author confirms, narrows ({binding} / .field) or replaces: they are never written into a spec and never checked for correctness here. Rules are applied in order; every matching rule adds its references once.",
 "rules": [
  {"id": "spill", "re": "\\b(spill|spilt|spills|spilled|overflow|overflows|drip|drips|dripping|splash|splashes|splashing|slosh|puddle|leak|leaks|leaking|seep)", "by": ["flag:spills", "house:mess_relocated", "house:wet"]},
